Z||000000||Jaei Sun||10-18-2001||01:30 AM||||I was checking out some Del-Sols today as maybe a replacement for my daily driver beretta and got to thinking... "Could parts of this interior me modified for fiero interior use?"<P>Wondering if anyone has done/seen any cars at shows (or anywhere else) with a similar swap done??<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://home.mn.rr.com/fierojaei/trans_fiero_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||5
Z||000001||yo_sweet||10-18-2001||02:25 PM||||del- sol ----uglyest thing that ever rolled out of honda<P>mr2 -ugly but at least the motor is in the right place<P><P>------------------<BR>1986 Fiero SE<BR>customized tail light's,american raceing rim's,k&n air filter,pioneer cd player.. more to come<P>kill's: 1990 Honda CRX,93 ACURA integra, 85 mr2,94 pontiac grand am,94 mustang, suzuki swift 5 car lengths!,86 laser 4cyl.<P>loses: 1996 camero Z28,2000 grand prix 3.8L, 1986 monty carlo SS||||reg||1
Z||000002||Fformula88||10-18-2001||03:35 PM||||I don't think the del Sol's are ugly... just plain.  I also do not know of any such interior swaps.  I do like the del Sol interior, but it might be a bit too small.  Their interiors just feel more cramped to me than the Fiero's.  MR-2... I have no idea but isn't putting any MR-2 parts on a Fiero a kind of sacrilege?? (sp?)||||reg||1
Z||000003||Pheagey||10-18-2001||04:17 PM||||1)Del Sol's: Arn't they just Civic's w.o the back seat? (i.e: Rice-a-holic?)<BR>2)MR2? WTF u thinkin'?<BR>3)Whats wrong with gettin another Fiero interior put in?..<BR>My 2c (not meant as a flame)<P>'88 coupe 'Hotwheels' <A HREF="Http://www.LithiumEffects.com/car.html" TARGET=_blank>Http://www.LithiumEffects.com/car.html</A> <BR>Kills: '97 Civic Auto.||||reg||13
