Z||000023||FieroMaster88||10-19-2001||04:37 PM||||Del Sol's are sweet!  I have a friend who has one.  Has a racing suspension and everything.  Man does that thing handle.  OOh yeah, cant forget the Targa top.  <P>If you want to call me a ricer, go for it!  All of my friends drive moded rice, and they can get quick.  I don't mind working on rice either.  There certainly is a lot you can do with a Honda, Mitsubishi, Toyota and VW.  Most of the people who mod them are pretty open minded.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jamessig.jpg">                  <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>Not your ordinary 88 coupe!||||reg||1
